    "readme_description": "Given an array of `n` integers `nums`, a **132 pattern** is a subsequence of three integers `nums[i]`, `nums[j]` and `nums[k]` such that `i < j < k` and `nums[i] < nums[k] < nums[j]`.\n\nReturn `true` *if there is a **132 pattern** in* `nums`, otherwise, return `false`.",
